  data: {
    LLM: '1. **First Betting Round**: Following the blinds. 2. **First Draw**: Players discard any number of cards (0-4) and receive replacements. 3. **Second Betting Round**. 4. **Second Draw**. 5. **Third Betting Round**. 6. **Third Draw**. 7. **Final Betting Round**. 8. **Showdown**.',
    Player: '1. **First Betting Round**: Following the blinds. 2. **First Draw**: Players discard any number of cards (0-4) and receive replacements. 3. **Second Betting Round**. 4. **Second Draw**. 5. **Third Betting Round**. 6. **Third Draw**. 7. **Final Betting Round**. 8. **Showdown**.',
    objective: "Capture the pot by holding the lowest qualifying hand at showdown. A 4-card 'Badugi' (all different suits/ranks) is the highest tier of hand.",
